id: genetic-focus-konatsians
name: Genetic Focus: Konatsians
order: 9
category: body
# "[Uncanny Monster]": it replaces that Primary Racial Trait - which, the table's. (1) Its Prerequisite, the Konatsian Genes Factor Trait,
# shown and never enforced.
importance: primary
# Its own description was given cut short ("T"): asked for.
text: >
  Genetic Focus: Konatsians (Body) [Uncanny Monster]:
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: Konatsian Genes Factor Trait
  (2)-[Passive]: Gain access to the Konatsian-Raised Factor Trait.
  (3)-[Passive]: While you are below the Injured Health Threshold, you may spend 3 Adaptation Points and 3(bT) Ki Points as if they were 1 Tension.
---

[passive]
# (2) Konatsian-Raised added by hand from the Traits tab, as any Racial Trait is (the user's: the system does not control which Racial
# Traits a character has).
# (3) Injured or Critical: where a Vocation's effect spends Tension, after Tension and Inherited Tension, 3 Adaptation Points and 3(bT) Ki
# Points for each (chat.mjs vocationTension, spendVocationTension). A Vocation's effect written as a script, spending `tension.stacks`
# itself, does not reach it.
allow focusKonatsians.tension;
